OL,3,GNEWSAADHD education petition reaches
OL,4,A10,000 signatures
OL,5,
OL,6,FA petition to make ADHD education in
OL,7,Fschools mandatory has reached 10,000
OL,8,Fsignatures in just two weeks.
OL,10,FRyan Swain, from Malton, launched the
OL,11,Fcampaign in a bid to reduce the stigma
OL,12,Faround neurodiversity and encourage
OL,13,Fearlier support.
OL,15,FThe 36-year-old said he grew up with
OL,16,Fundiagnosed ADHD and Tourette's
OL,17,Fsyndrome and was permanently excluded
OL,18,Ffrom mainstream education when he was
OL,19,F14 years old.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
